# CorelDRAW source artwork
# Working files only — the game runs from the exported PNGs in Assets/.
# These are large binaries (~50 MB) that Git stores in full on every change.
Corel/
*.cdr
*.cdr.bak

# Export archives — the loose PNGs in Assets/ are what the game loads.
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z

